{"openapi":"3.1.0","info":{"title":"C3 Orchestra Backend","description":"User authentication and billing API","version":"1.0.0"},"paths":{"/api/auth/login":{"post":{"tags":["auth"],"summary":"Login","description":"Verify Turnkey session and return JWT token\n\nRequest body:\n{\n    \"token\": \"eyJ...\"  (Turnkey session token)\n}\n\nReturns:\n{\n    \"token\": \"eyJ...\",  (Our JWT token, valid for 30 days)\n    \"expires_in\": 2592000\n}\n\nThe userId and organizationId are extracted from the Turnkey token payload.","operationId":"login_api_auth_login_post","requestBody":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/LoginRequest"}}},"required":true},"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/LoginResponse"}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}},"/api/auth/wallet/challenge":{"post":{"tags":["auth"],"summary":"Wallet Challenge","description":"Generate a challenge for wallet signature authentication\n\n    Request body:\n    {\n        \"wallet\": \"0x123...\"\n    }\n\n    Returns:\n    {\n        \"timestamp\": 1732136789,\n        \"message\": \"Sign in to Compute3\n\nTimestamp: 1732136789\nWallet: 0x123...\"\n    }\n\n    The timestamp is used to prevent replay attacks. The signature must be verified\n    within WALLET_LOGIN_TIMEOUT seconds (default: 60s).","operationId":"wallet_challenge_api_auth_wallet_challenge_post","requestBody":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/WalletChallengeRequest"}}},"required":true},"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/WalletChallengeResponse"}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}},"/api/auth/wallet/login":{"post":{"tags":["auth"],"summary":"Wallet Login","description":"Verify wallet signature and return JWT token\n\nRequest body:\n{\n    \"wallet\": \"0x123...\",\n    \"signature\": \"0xabc...\",\n    \"timestamp\": 1732136789\n}\n\nReturns:\n{\n    \"token\": \"eyJ...\",\n    \"expires_in\": 2592000\n}\n\nThis endpoint:\n1. Verifies the timestamp is within WALLET_LOGIN_TIMEOUT seconds\n2. Recovers the signing address from the signature\n3. Verifies it matches the provided wallet address\n4. Creates a new FREE user if this is their first login\n5. Returns a JWT token (with user_id, wallet, login_type) valid for 30 days\n\nThe client is responsible for storing the token in cookies (same as Turnkey /auth/login).","operationId":"wallet_login_api_auth_wallet_login_post","requestBody":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/WalletLoginRequest"}}},"required":true},"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/LoginResponse"}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}},"/api/x402/top_up":{"post":{"tags":["x402"],"summary":"Top Up","description":"Process a top-up payment (paid via x402).\n\nThis endpoint is protected by x402 middleware which verifies the payment signature\nand settles it in the background. The middleware ensures the payment is valid\nbefore this endpoint is called.\n\nSECURITY: The actual amount credited is extracted from the VERIFIED X-PAYMENT header\n(the signed payment payload), NOT from the request body. The request body amount\nis ignored to prevent attackers from claiming a larger amount than they paid.\n\nRequest body:\n{\n    \"user_id\": \"uuid\",\n    \"amount\": 10.00  (informational only - actual amount from X-PAYMENT header)\n}\n\nReturns:\n{\n    \"user_id\": \"uuid\",\n    \"amount\": 10.00,  (actual verified amount from payment)\n    \"wallet\": \"0x123...\",\n    \"transaction_id\": \"uuid\",\n    \"message\": \"Top-up of $10.00 received successfully!\"\n}","operationId":"top_up_api_x402_top_up_post","requestBody":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/TopUpRequest"}}},"required":true},"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/TopUpResponse"}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}},"/api/balance":{"get":{"tags":["billing"],"summary":"Get User Balance","description":"Get current user's balance (regular + rewards)","operationId":"get_user_balance_api_balance_get","parameters":[{"name":"X-API-KEY","in":"header","required":false,"schema":{"type":"string","title":"X-Api-Key"}},{"name":"Authorization","in":"header","required":false,"schema":{"type":"string","title":"Authorization"}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/BalanceResponse"}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}},"/api/tx":{"get":{"tags":["billing"],"summary":"List User Transactions","description":"Get user's transaction history (excludes SUPERSEDED transactions by default)","operationId":"list_user_transactions_api_tx_get","parameters":[{"name":"transaction_type","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"anyOf":[{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/TransactionType"},{"type":"null"}],"description":"Filter by transaction type","title":"Transaction Type"},"description":"Filter by transaction type"},{"name":"status","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"anyOf":[{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/TransactionStatus"},{"type":"null"}],"description":"Filter by status","title":"Status"},"description":"Filter by status"},{"name":"rewards","in":"query","requ